# Phys4D agent rule

This repo tracks the **Milestone 2 six-phase spine** (param ID from video → sim rollout → Gaussian render). Do not guess progress from memory.

## Every session

1. Read and update `docs/PROJECT_CHECKLIST.md` (status `[x]` / `[~]` / `[ ]`).
2. Match work to phases 1–6; note risks (object→Gaussian mapping, no friction in v1).
3. Do not reintroduce the removed `visual_dynamics` extrapolation path unless the user explicitly asks.

## Primary artifacts

| Phase | Path |
|-------|------|
| 1 | `configs/param_id_dataset.json`, `outputs/param_id_dataset/`, `dataset_manifest.json` |
| 2–3 | `src/phys4d/param_ident/`, `scripts/train_param_predictor.py`, `outputs/param_predictor/` |
| 4 | `warp_gaussians_to_frame.py`, Modal 4DGS, inference script (TBD) |
| 5 | eval scripts + ablations (TBD) |
